  "description": "This application proposes to install one external condensing unit to provide adequate comfort cooling to the property. \n\nThis application builds upon the previously consented scheme (25/02703/FULL and 25/02704/LBC), which included the replacement of the existing gas boiler with an air source heat pump located within the communal rooftop plant area. However, it has since been confirmed that the flat's electricity supply is restricted to single-phase, which limits the capacity of the proposed heat pump; following a detailed assessment of the property’s heating and cooling requirements, the professional team has therefore determined that an additional condensing unit is necessary to meet the calculated demand.",
